    "about-philosophy-info": {
      "type": "about-philosophy-info",
      "disabled": true,
      "settings": {
        "title": "PHILOSOPHY OF SLOW BEAUTY",
        "sub_title": "BALANCED QUANTITY of essential ingredients = THE PERFECT FORMULA, that considers the true physiological needs of the skin",
        "description": "<p>MORE – IS NOT BETTER. A large number of ingredients overwhelms the skin. It's like a person simultaneously reacting to a large number of stimuli. Multitasking exists, but the output is always enormous fatigue, apathy and burnout. We are adherents of a conscious \"Slow Beauty\" approach, which goes hand in hand with the increasingly popular \"Slow Food\" trend. These approaches are about:</p><ul><li><strong>mindful consumption</strong></li><li><strong>getting the result not at any cost</strong></li><li><strong>ethical interaction with the world.</strong></li></ul><p>That is,Moderate impact on the skin without overstimulation. And if there is one thing in our formulas that is abundant, it is anti-inflammatory, moisturizing and soothing components.</p>"
      }
    },
    "resens-definition": {
      "type": "resens-definition",
      "settings": {
        "header_1": "",
        "header_2": "Increasing endorphin levels",
        "text_1": "<b>Reducing cortisol levels</b>. Сortisol released under stress through the hypothalamic‑pituitary‑adrenal axis, directly weakens skin’s protective functions, increases inflammatory reactions, and degrades collagen and elastin. The A‑REDENSITY formula contains a turmeric stem cell biotechnological complex that reduces cortisol synthesis and suppresses pro‑inflammatory interleukins (IL). In vitro results show inflammation reduced by up to 78%, and collagen/elastin protection against cortisol damage reaching 89–96%. This helps preserve skin firmness and reduce visible stress signs — redness, swelling, and loss of tone.",
        "text_2": ". Peptides in the line inhibit release of the neuropeptide CGRP from sensory nerve endings, reducing irritation and increasing resistance to environmental aggressors. Within 60 minutes of application in vivo, skin reactivity to stimuli softens significantly. Crucially, these peptides stimulate production of β‑endorphins and met‑enkephalins — known as “happiness hormones.” They help reduce neural and muscular activity, relieve tension, and enhance comfort, thereby reducing skin hypersensitivity.",
        "conclusion": ""
      }
    },
